Package: doclr
Title: R Client for the 'docling-serve' REST API
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Yves", "Amevoin", , "amevoin@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A pure-R, tidyverse-oriented client for the 'docling-serve'
    document conversion REST API. Submits documents by URL or by file
    upload, synchronously or asynchronously, polls long-running tasks and
    returns results as a document object that can be rendered to Markdown,
    plain text, HTML, JSON or DocTags. Includes optional helpers to
    provision and manage a local 'docling-serve' container. No Python
    runtime is required.
